# Security

- Read secrets from environment / runtime config only.
- Production must fail safely if a required platform secret is missing.
- OAuth: validate state, protect callbacks, least privilege scopes.
- Mask secrets in logs and API error payloads.
- Validate object-storage paths. No path traversal.
- Human-only: CAPTCHA, MFA, OAuth consent, KYC, payout, legal acceptance, platform-required post confirmation.
- AME must never autonomously raise hard caps, buy services, change bank details, disable safety, or create fake engagement.
